# The image copies exactly one build artifact, `${JAR_FILE}`, which resolves to
# `build/libs/<module>-<version>.jar`. Without this file the whole module directory is uploaded on
# every build; with a blanket `build/` line the image stops building, because the JAR lives inside
# the tree being excluded. The four lines below keep the one file `COPY` reads and drop the rest.
/.gradle/
/build/*
!/build/libs/
/build/libs/*
!/build/libs/*.jar
